<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/72201AHVJHMKDPLTHSHSHMMBQTMGGKBCN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Chilliwack";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\"> </span><span class=\"BoldText\">After 55 years of</span> <span class=\"ItalicText\">making</span><span class=\"BoldText\"> music, Chilliwack is hitting the road one last time!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With their <span class=\"ItalicText\">Farewell to Friends Tour</span>, Chilliwack is celebrating more than five decades of music and the songs that have become part of the soundtrack to generations of Canadian music fans.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From “Fly at Night” and “California Girl” to “Lonesome Mary” and “My Girl (Gone, Gone, Gone),” their catalogue is packed with songs you know, love and probably still remember every word to!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With 12 albums, a string of radio hits and 15 gold and platinum album certifications, Chilliwack helped shape the sound of Canadian rock. And more than five decades later, their music still gets audiences singing along.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join Chilliwack at the Tidemark Theatre for one last chance to experience these classic hits live. Come sing along, celebrate the music and give this iconic band the send-off they deserve!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Because this time, when they sing <span class=\"ItalicText\">“Gone, Gone, Gone,”</span> they really mean it.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $78 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-03-18T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
