<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/70401ASVSQQQCRPSCNRQPCKDQQQTGLMGK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "CRX's Christmas Spectacular";
  schema:description """
	CR DanceXtreme Inc. proudly presents, “CRX’s Christmas Spectacular, A Claus for Celebration”! This special performance will feature both our recreational and award-winning competitive programs dancing in various styles to old and new Christmas holiday music.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Our first performance will be on Friday, December 4th at 7:30pm. We will also have a matinee at 1:30pm and an evening show at 6:00pm on Saturday, December 5th. Buy your tickets soon as they are sure to sell out fast.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All our talented, young dancers are excited to perform and entertain you and the entire family so come out and celebrate the Christmas holiday with us!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $43.00 Admission<span class=\"ItalicText\"> (including GST, +applicable fees)</span>
""";
