  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "In Tyee Country";
  schema:description """
	A century-old fishing club on Canada’s west coast faces an existential crisis as salmon populations dwindle and members wrestle with their legacy, realizing that their biggest catches might be a thing of the past.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for the Vancouver Island premiere of <span class=\"ItalicText\">In Tyee Country, </span>a TELUS Originals documentary. Filmmakers Jevan Crittenden and Nate Slaco will be in attendance for a Q&A following the screening.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Runtime: 71 minutes<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets:$18.00 Adult, $15.00 Senior 65+ <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
