<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/73201AGSCKBTGSBVVPVMMGBMDMVPLHBVG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "King, Cash, and Diamond Forever!";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Four Legends. One Electrifying Live Concert.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>An exceptional Tribute to Elvis, Johnny Cash, and Neil Diamond - AMPLIFIED!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready for an unforgettable night of music as tributes to four legendary icons take the stage in <span class=\"BoldText\">KING, CASH & DIAMOND FOREVER! </span>in a spectacular, high-energy theatrical concert experience!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring the incredible talents of Darren Lee as Elvis Presley and Johnny Cash, Jennifer Rae as June Carter-Cash, and Jason Scott as Neil Diamond, this dynamic production brings the timeless music of these musical legends to life with the power, passion and excitement of a full live band.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Backed by The Amplified Band, this is far more than a traditional tribute show. This show brings the music to a whole new level with powerhouse vocals, exceptional musicianship and an exciting concert that will have you singing along from the first note to the final encore.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From the rock ’n’ roll energy of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Jailhouse Rock</span>, to the unmistakable rhythm of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Ring of Fire</span>, to the crowd-favourite anthem <span class=\"ItalicText\">Sweet Caroline</span>, experience the songs that have captivated generations — performed live with fresh energy and spectacular stage presence.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With more than 38 years of experience, Darren Lee is an internationally acclaimed Elvis tribute artist whose career highlights include becoming the first Canadian to win the World Elvis Contest in Memphis in 1997, performing for more than 11 years at the Stratosphere in Las Vegas, and starring in the acclaimed Maui production <span class=\"ItalicText\">Burn’n Love</span>. Alongside Jason Scott’s compelling portrayal of Neil Diamond and Jennifer Rae’s celebration of June Carter-Cash, this production delivers a memorable night of legendary music and entertainment.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Four legendary artists. One powerhouse live band. One unforgettable night.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Experience the music, the memories and the magic of <span class=\"BoldText\">KING, CASH & DIAMOND FOREVER! with The Amplified Band</span> — like you’ve never seen them before!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $57 Adult, $52.00 Senior 65+, $42 Student, $50 Groups 6+ <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-01-30T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/files/03c9adc9-a9a3-4469-be00-9916d31611d7.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/location/405AGDKDKNLGVLJCSNTLQBVTRTGBTHCPJ>;
