  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Midnight at the Maritime";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Set sail for a night of nautical elegance, dancing, and midnight magic!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ring in 2027 at the Maritime Heritage Centre with a New Year's Eve celebration you won't want to miss!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a 19+ DJ dance party featuring Ms. Rockwell, DJ Greyzone, and N.I.J. Dance the night away, enjoy a drink from our cash bar, and celebrate the countdown to midnight in style!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With door prizes, a silent auction, great music, and a festive nautical atmosphere, it's the perfect way to welcome the new year while supporting a great local cause.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This event is a fundraiser for the Maritime Heritage Society, supporting the preservation and celebration of our coastal maritime heritage.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Let's make some waves as we welcome 2027!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $45 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
