  schema:description """
	Discovery Singers presents their winter performance Saturday, December 05, 2026<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Campbell River United Church<span><br/></span>Show at 6:30pm (doors at 6:00pm)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“Northern Echo” will highlight contemporary music celebrating the strength of Canadian female and two-spirit performers, collaborators, and arrangers. You will hear popular selections from Sarah McLachlan, Jeremy Dutcher, Nelly Furtado and more!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring musical guests Wes Underhill and Alley McCulloch, Discovery Singers will be joined again by their wonderful band:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Keith Goddard, guitar</li><li> Dylan Gordan, bass</li><li> Tim Petkau, piano</li><li> Corijn de Roo, percussion</li><li> Ben Verkerk, saxophone</li></ul><span><br/></span>This event will be the perfect start to your holiday season, minus the classics and carols. Tickets sold very quickly last spring, so don’t wait too long. Come and celebrate local musicians and arts in your community.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $20 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
