<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/69601ANKVPKVRSPMHRSMLLQSTRLSKPHPR>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Pop Goes The Sixties";
  schema:description """
	BackBeat Entertainment is proud to present, POP GOES THE SIXTIES! A live variety show and multimedia presentation, celebrating the music of five legendary musical groups, in one incredible show, lovingly performed by Backbeat, Canada’s most authentic musical tribute to the 1960s.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It's a magical evening of top 10 hits from The Beatles, The Beach Boys, The Rolling Stones, The Monkees, and Creedence Clearwater Revival. You'll be transported back in time to re-live the sights and sounds of a sixties pop musical show that is sure to have you tapping your toes, singing along, and cheering all night long.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With that sixties sizzling sound, dazzling video on three projection screens that pop, and a special nostalgic flare of sixties video footage that will take you back to a much simpler time when music changed the world we live in.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>As Ed Sullivan called it... \"A really big shoe!\". Don't miss this once in a lifetime event…<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get your tickets now!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $50.00 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Oya9N6M-7t4\">Watch their video here!</a>
""";
