<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/69801ACHMQQPHNNNRPKGGCKPVPDJPPBTJ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Sweeney Todd";
  schema:description """
	<h2>Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">A Musical Thriller by Stephen Sondheim and Hugh Wheeler</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Attend the tale of Sweeney Todd, the infamous Demon Barber of Fleet Street!!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Set in the shadowy streets of Victorian London, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Sweeney Todd</span> tells the haunting story of a man consumed by injustice, loss, and revenge. Returning home after years of wrongful exile, Sweeney Todd discovers that his life has been destroyed by a corrupt judge who stole his family and future. Fueled by vengeance, he forms an unlikely partnership with the resourceful Mrs. Lovett, owner of a struggling pie shop. Together, they embark on a dark and chilling venture that will forever change Fleet Street.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This dark comedy has spectacular music from Stephen Sondheim and an ending that will leave you at the edge of your seat.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">*Not recommended for small children </span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $40.50 Admission, $30.50 Student <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span><span><br/></span>
""";
