  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Campb</span><span class=\"BoldText\">ell River!!</span> The <span class=\"BoldText\">DREAMS - FLEETWOOD MAC & ARRIVAL - ABBA Tribute Concert Returns</span>!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready to experience the magic of two iconic bands under one roof at the <span class=\"BoldText\">Tidemark Theatre</span>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a night filled with nostalgia, great music, and unforgettable performances.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Don't miss out on this incredible opportunity to relive the hits that shaped music history.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Grab your tickets now and get ready to Sing Your Heart Out!!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $49.45 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
