<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/73001AVCMHLKGJVPNKDTRBKJNMCBVTBRQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Legend of Garth Brooks Tribute";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">This is as close as it gets to Garth Brooks.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>An electrifying, high energy, award-winning show fronted by CCMA nominated country singer Chris Buck of the Chris Buck Band.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Raised on Garth’s music, Chris grew up cranking his records, idolizing his sound, and shaping his own career around the unforgettable live experience that made Garth a legend. With a gold record and over 20 million streams, he now leads an all-star band that delivers the look, sound, and energy fans know and love.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready for a night that brings the spirit of Garth Brooks to life. This is one you won’t forget.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $59.00 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(includes GST, +applicable fees)</span>
""";
