<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/72001ANHVHCLGLNCCVMNNJLHCJHVKDPJB>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Spirit of India";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">An Evening of Live Bollywood & Punjabi Singing and Bhangra Dance</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready for an unforgettable evening of music, dance, and vibrant Indian culture!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Presented by <span class=\"BoldText\">Jalsa Events</span>, this spectacular show brings together soulful Bollywood melodies, energetic Punjabi hits, and electrifying Bhangra performances by <span class=\"BoldText\">Folk Star Bhangra</span>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Experience colourful costumes, powerful rhythms, live music, and the infectious energy of India—all on one stage!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Whether you're a Bollywood fan or discovering Indian culture for the first time, this family-friendly celebration promises entertainment for everyone.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Feel the Music. Experience the Culture. Celebrate the Spirit of India!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $35 Admission, $30 Student/Senior/Groups of 4+, $19 Child age 6-12, 5 and under free with a ticketed adult! <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
