<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/65801ABDQQTPTQHTDJVCCJNHQLNRJJCBG>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Sweet Caroline Tour";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"ItalicText\">The Sweet Caroline Tour: A Tribute to Neil Diamond</span> is a celebration of one of the most enduring songbooks in popular music history - an era when songs were written with heart, soul and honesty, and melodies stayed with you for a lifetime.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This outstanding live production recreates that feeling in the most authentic way possible, with a full live band, powerful backing vocalists and a frontman whose voice and presence capture the unmistakable spirit of Neil Diamond. From iconic stadium anthems to deeply loved classics, every performance is delivered with energy, respect and a deep love for the music.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Hear all the timeless hits: Sweet Caroline, Song Sung Blue, Red Red Wine, Cracklin’ Rosie, Forever in Blue Jeans, Cherry Cherry, Crunchy Granola Suite, Shilo, Solitary Man, Kentucky Woman, I Am… I Said, Holly Holy, Soolaimon and more.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sing along, relive the magic and remember what great live music truly sounds like.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">The Sweet Caroline Tour: A Tribute to Neil Diamond</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Website   <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://sweetcarolinetribute.com/\">sweetcarolinetribute.com</a><span><br/></span>Facebook   <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/thesweetcarolinetour\">thesweetcarolinetour</a><span><br/></span>Instagram   <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thesweetcarolinetour/\">thesweetcarolinetour</a><span><br/></span>Official Hashtag   #thesweetcarolinetour<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $79.00 Admission, $69.00 Senior 65+ <span class=\"ItalicText\">(includes GST, +applicable fees)</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Promotional Video <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mgHqaXp1J6E\">https://youtu.be/mgHqaXp1J6E</a> 
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-03-04T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/files/73f11d9d-eef7-440f-8147-94d3677f325e.jpg>;
