  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Willy Wonka";
  schema:description """
	RainCoast School of Musical Theatre is proud to present MTI's Willy Wonka. (Based on Roald Dahl's book Charlie and the Chocolate Factory.) Grab your Golden ticket and join Wonka, Charlie, the Oompa Loompa's and all of the lucky kids for a tour of Wonka's Chocolate Factory! This sweet treat is filled with wonderful music, fun costumes, lots of laughter and the crazy, zany world of the one and only Willy Wonka.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Show Dates </span><span><br/></span>Wed Dec 2 7:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group A class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Thurs Dec 3 7:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group B class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Fri Dec 4 7:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group A class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sat Dec 5 2:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group B class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sat Dec 5 7:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group A class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Sun Dec 6 2:00 PM<span><br/></span>(Includes Thurs group B class)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $20 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span><span><br/></span>
